      "oldOffset": 2699,
      "newOffset": 2931,
      "before": "          <p class=\"cx-eyebrow\">FINANCIAL REALITY</p>\n          <h1 class=\"cx-display\" data-cx-en=\"See where you are before deciding what to do.\" data-cx-zh=\"先看清你在哪里，再决定要做什么。\">See where you are before deciding what to do.</h1>\n          <p class=\"cx-lead\" data-cx-en=\"Bring household scope, income, expenses, assets, liabilities, protection, goals, documents and unknowns into one dated view. Calculations, findings, planning and professional judgment stay visibly separate.\" data-cx-zh=\"把家庭范围、收入、支出、资产、负债、保障、目标、文件与未知项放进同一个有日期的视图。计算、发现、规划与专业判断始终清楚分层。\">Bring household scope, income, expenses, assets, liabilities, protection, goals, documents and unknowns into one dated view. Calculations, findings, planning and professional judgment stay visibly separate.</p>\n          <p class=\"cx-p1-note\" data-cx-en=\"Financial Reality can organize and calculate. It does not turn a number or system finding into a recommendation.\" data-cx-zh=\"Financial Reality 可以整理与计算，但不会把数字或系统发现自动变成建议。\">Financial Reality can organize and calculate. It does not turn a number or system finding into a recommendation.</p>\n",
      "after": "          <p data-cx-zh=\"财务与生活\" data-cx-en=\"EVERYDAY FINANCES\" class=\"cx-eyebrow\">EVERYDAY FINANCES</p>\n          <h1 class=\"cx-display\" data-cx-en=\"Make sense of your everyday finances.\" data-cx-zh=\"把生活里的钱，整理清楚。\">Make sense of your everyday finances.</h1>\n          <p class=\"cx-lead\" data-cx-en=\"Start with income and spending. See what remains each month, how far your accessible savings could stretch, and what your next goal needs.\" data-cx-zh=\"从收入和支出开始，看看每月能留下多少、手边的储备能支持多久，以及下一项目标还差多少。\">Start with income and spending. See what remains each month, how far your accessible savings could stretch, and what your next goal needs.</p>\n          <div class=\"cx-cluster\"><a class=\"cx-button\" href=\"#financial-information\" data-finance-task=\"incomeStreams\" data-cx-en=\"Organize my income and spending\" data-cx-zh=\"整理我的收支\">Organize my income and spending</a><a class=\"cx-button cx-button--secondary\" href=\"#financial-saved\" data-cx-en=\"Continue saved information\" data-cx-zh=\"继续已保存的资料\">Continue saved information</a></div>\n"
