      "before": "    <section class=\"cx-section--tight\">\n",
      "after": "    <section class=\"cx-section--tight\" aria-labelledby=\"finance-report-preview-title\">\n      <div class=\"cx-container cx-card\">\n        <h2 id=\"finance-report-preview-title\" data-cx-en=\"RM69 · Personal &amp; Household Financial Preparation Report\" data-cx-zh=\"RM69 · 个人与家庭财务准备报告\">RM69 · Personal &amp; Household Financial Preparation Report</h2>\n        <p data-cx-en=\"One bilingual report, with Chinese and English together on the core pages. Loan and rental details are optional appendices. Synthetic previews remain review candidates. Paid generation is not available yet.\" data-cx-zh=\"一份双语报告，核心页面同页呈现中文与英文，贷款与租金明细按需进入附录。合成预览仍为审阅候选；付费生成尚未开放。\">One bilingual report, with Chinese and English together on the core pages. Loan and rental details are optional appendices. Synthetic previews remain review candidates. Paid generation is not available yet.</p>\n        <a class=\"cx-button cx-button--secondary\" href=\"/professional/financial/report-preview/\" data-cx-en=\"View report samples\" data-cx-zh=\"查看报告样页\">View report samples</a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n<section class=\"cx-section\" id=\"business-services\" aria-labelledby=\"business-services-title\"><div class=\"cx-container cx-stack cx-stack--loose\"><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"BUSINESS &amp; FINANCIAL TRANSFORMATION\" data-cx-zh=\"企业与财务转型\" class=\"cx-eyebrow\">BUSINESS & FINANCIAL TRANSFORMATION</p><h2 data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Understand the finances before deciding what to change.\" data-cx-zh=\"先理解财务，再决定如何改变。\" id=\"business-services-title\" class=\"cx-title\">Understand the finances before deciding what to change.</h2><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Explore the service scope and prepare questions for a first conversation. This public page does not accept private business documents or open an automated paid report.\" data-cx-zh=\"先了解服务范围，为初步沟通整理问题。本公开页面不接收私人企业文件，也未开放自动付费报告。\" class=\"cx-lead\">Explore the service scope and prepare questions for a first conversation. This public page does not accept private business documents or open an automated paid report.</p><div class=\"cx-grid cx-grid--2\"><article class=\"cx-card\"><h3 data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Business financial analysis\" data-cx-zh=\"企业财务分析\" class=\"cx-heading-2\">Business financial analysis</h3><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Prepare a dated view of revenue, costs, assets, liabilities and source evidence. Business document submission is not open.\" data-cx-zh=\"整理有日期的收入、成本、资产、负债及来源证据。企业文件提交尚未开放。\" >Prepare a dated view of revenue, costs, assets, liabilities and source evidence. Business document submission is not open.</p></article><article class=\"cx-card\"><h3 data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Cash flow &amp; owner liquidity\" data-cx-zh=\"现金流与经营者资金\" class=\"cx-heading-2\">Cash flow & owner liquidity</h3><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Separate business profit, cash commitments and money actually received by the owner. Company cash is not automatically available to the household.\" data-cx-zh=\"区分企业利润、现金承诺与经营者实际所得。公司现金不会自动成为家庭可用资金。\" >Separate business profit, cash commitments and money actually received by the owner. Company cash is not automatically available to the household.</p></article><article class=\"cx-card\"><h3 data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Tax readiness &amp; planning support\" data-cx-zh=\"税务资料准备与规划支持\" class=\"cx-heading-2\">Tax readiness & planning support</h3><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Identify records and questions for a qualified tax reviewer. Company tax, capital allowances and benefits-in-kind calculations are not offered here.\" data-cx-zh=\"整理需交由合资格税务人员审核的记录与问题。此处不提供公司税、资本津贴或实物福利税额计算。\" >Identify records and questions for a qualified tax reviewer. Company tax, capital allowances and benefits-in-kind calculations are not offered here.</p></article><article class=\"cx-card\"><h3 data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Business process excellence\" data-cx-zh=\"业务流程改善准备\" class=\"cx-heading-2\">Business process excellence</h3><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Clarify responsibilities, handoffs, evidence and existing performance measures before discussing changes. This does not execute business actions.\" data-cx-zh=\"讨论改善前，先明确责任、交接、证据与已有绩效指标。此处不会代为执行业务行动。\" >Clarify responsibilities, handoffs, evidence and existing performance measures before discussing changes. This does not execute business actions.</p></article><article class=\"cx-card\"><h3 data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Family wealth &amp; business succession preparation\" data-cx-zh=\"家庭财富与企业传承准备\" class=\"cx-heading-2\">Family wealth & business succession preparation</h3><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Map ownership, family consent and questions about Will, Trust or succession arrangements. Legal preparation and signing require the appropriate professional.\" data-cx-zh=\"梳理权属、家庭同意，以及遗嘱、信托或企业传承安排的问题。法律文件准备与签署须由适当专业人员处理。\" >Map ownership, family consent and questions about Will, Trust or succession arrangements. Legal preparation and signing require the appropriate professional.</p></article><article class=\"cx-card\"><h3 data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Professional financial review\" data-cx-zh=\"专业财务复核\" class=\"cx-heading-2\">Professional financial review</h3><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Prepare the facts and scope for an attributable reviewer. Qualification, engagement, availability and any deliverable must be confirmed before a service begins.\" data-cx-zh=\"为具名审核人准备事实与范围。服务开始前须确认资格、委托、可用性与实际交付内容。\" >Prepare the facts and scope for an attributable reviewer. Qualification, engagement, availability and any deliverable must be confirmed before a service begins.</p></article></div><div class=\"cx-card\"><h3 data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"What you can do now\" data-cx-zh=\"目前可以做什么\" >What you can do now</h3><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Read these explanations, try the existing personal and household tools below, and view the personal and household report samples for free. Those samples do not represent a released Business report.\" data-cx-zh=\"免费阅读这些说明、使用下方既有个人与家庭工具，并查看个人与家庭报告样页。这些样页不代表已发布的企业报告。\" >Read these explanations, try the existing personal and household tools below, and view the personal and household report samples for free. Those samples do not represent a released Business report.</p><div class=\"cx-cluster\"><a data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"View personal &amp; household samples\" data-cx-zh=\"查看个人与家庭样页\" class=\"cx-button cx-button--secondary\" href=\"/professional/financial/report-preview/\">View personal & household samples</a><a data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Read the appointment process\" data-cx-zh=\"了解预约流程\" class=\"cx-button cx-button--secondary\" href=\"/professional/appointments/\">Read the appointment process</a><a data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Ask about the service scope\" data-cx-zh=\"询问服务范围\" class=\"cx-button\" href=\"mailto:getphios.cs@gmail.com?subject=Business%20service%20enquiry\">Ask about the service scope</a></div><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"For an enquiry, share only your general question and preferred contact details. Do not email financial statements, identity documents, account numbers or passwords. An enquiry does not confirm an appointment or authorize a professional service.\" data-cx-zh=\"询问时只提供一般问题与希望使用的联系方式。请勿电邮财务报表、身份证明、账户号码或密码。询问不等于确认预约或授权专业服务。\" >For an enquiry, share only your general question and preferred contact details. Do not email financial statements, identity documents, account numbers or passwords. An enquiry does not confirm an appointment or authorize a professional service.</p></div><details class=\"cx-card\"><summary><span data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Uploads, payment and delivery\" data-cx-zh=\"文件上传、付款与交付\" >Uploads, payment and delivery</span></summary><p data-pis-copy data-cx-en=\"Private Business uploads and automated Business report purchases are closed. No payment is needed to read this page or the samples. Any future service must first state its reviewer, scope, price, deliverable and access conditions; no Business delivery is promised by an existing personal report price.\" data-cx-zh=\"私人企业文件上传及自动企业报告购买仍关闭。阅读本页与样页无需付款。未来服务须先明确审核人、范围、价格、交付内容与访问条件；既有个人报告价格不代表企业服务交付承诺。\" >Private Business uploads and automated Business report purchases are closed. No payment is needed to read this page or the samples. Any future service must first state its reviewer, scope, price, deliverable and access conditions; no Business delivery is promised by an existing personal report price.</p></details></div></section>\n    <section class=\"cx-section--tight\" id=\"financial-start\">\n"
